From 7f0708286054f290aeb23a15b92d4d5b50fe2ec8 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Thu, 5 Nov 2026 10:37:07 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] Blackbox: log d, rpmCmd_f, rpmOmega_f and rpmControlRan

Adds the inputs and output of the INDI rpm loop to the log, next to the
existing omegaSp. rpmControlRan is 1 when the closed loop law set d this
loop, 0 for open loop or when the controller is bypassed.

d and rpmCmd_f use the same scale as u, and the importer scales them back.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01ShSV4Ltz2bTZ7XNM5TnYWg
